# Telekinesis prevents a target attacker's combat damage, not damage dealt to it, and stops exactly two untaps (CR 615.1).
[Bot1 Deck]
Telekinesis
Mox Sapphire
Gleemox
Black Lotus
Grizzly Bears
Island x20
[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Trained Armodon
Island x20
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Gleemox.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Trained Armodon.Cast
[T4 Bot2.BeginCombat]
Bot2.Attack(Trained Armodon)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Gleemox.Activate(Color: Blue)
! Bot1.Hand.Telekinesis.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire)
Bot1.Hand.Telekinesis.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Trained Armodon)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Block(Grizzly Bears > Trained Armodon)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Damage = 0
? Bot2.Battlefield.Trained Armodon.Damage = 2
[T6 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Trained Armodon.Tapped = true
[T8 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Trained Armodon.Tapped = true
[T10 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Trained Armodon.Tapped = false
[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears.Power = 2
